:''For the enemy encountered in [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]], see [[Illyasviel (Enemy)]]. For the other Illyasviel from the same event, see [[Illya the Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Illyasviel''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 364
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Illyasviel
|name2 = Illyasviel CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Illyasviel CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Illyasviel is very similar to her [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|peers]] in that she has long range with mediocre stats and abilities. Reds and Metals are not the best candidates to bring slow against as they tend to be close ranged and generally tanky. Falling short on her niche again is that she lacks the all important [[Critical Hit]] to deal with Metals. However in the case she does land an attack before an enemy gets too close she may be able to hold back enemies such as [[Pure Gold R.Ost]] while mid to long-range Critters handle it. In cases where range is valued, she would be superior to [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Clockwork Cat]], who'd normally run headfirst into enemy attacks and die.

{{Job|Classification=Crowd-Controller}}

